      "content": "\"you're already gone, in a way\"... that's so heavy. but i guess you're right. everything feels so pointless. i wake up and there's no reason to even get out of bed. it's just a cycle of nothingness. is there really any point in pretending anymore? it feels like i'm just a ghost waiting for something to happen.",
